Cell["\<\
with and try are read as the compound rows: a success either returns inside \
them (nothing required) or leaves them and continues (the lemma: without a \
success return inside, every success goes through what follows, whatever path \
the body took or wherever it was cut short). Nested function definitions are \
not entered, so their returns are not the action's.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aefc9d06-908d-4b93-9f20-0deb8b18e77a"],

